                                "sense_id": "1773b89d-0aec-3538-86e5-909b2ceefeb2",
                                "text": "House GOP leaders believe the plan is on track to pass the chamber, arguing that Trump’s backing will help them win robust support among House Republicans on the floor this week, even as many ultraconservatives typically loathe such stopgap measures."
                            }
                        ]
